timeline
    title SDR milestones, 2019 to 2026
    section Services era
        2019 : cocina-models v0.1.0 : IBM cloud copy added
        2020 : sdr-api and H2 : RabbitMQ and JWT ADRs : NetApp to Ceph done
    section Cocina and consolidation
        2022 : Fedora 3 removed from DSA : pywb replaces OpenWayback
        2023 : Robots move from Resque to Sidekiq
        2024 : Indexing moves into DSA : purl-fetcher publish API : H3 replaces H2
        2025 : GCP copy added : Workflow server merged into DSA : Access apps drop MODS : Weka S3 read path
    section Current
        2026 : IBM copy dropped : GeoServer retired : Argo-B3 replacing Argo and pre-assembly
